# Set these in your editor's environment (REST Client) or replace them inline.
# Against the deployed stack, host is the `api_base_url` output host (CloudFront) and the path starts with /api/v1.
@host = http://localhost:8080
@apiKey = change-me-to-a-long-random-secret

# --- PRESETS ---

### Create Preset
POST {{host}}/api/v1/presets HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "name": "Thumbnail",
  "width": 480,
  "height": 320,
  "format": "webp",
  "quality": 60
}

### List Presets
GET {{host}}/api/v1/presets HTTP/1.1
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}


# --- ASSETS ---

### Create Asset (returns a presigned POST form: send upload.fields then the file as multipart to upload.url)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/assets HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "filename": "photo.jpg",
  "fileSizeBytes": 32456,
  "contentType": "image/jpeg"
}

### Get Assets (paged)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/assets?limit=20&offset=0 HTTP/1.1
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Asset
GET {{host}}/api/v1/assets/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000 HTTP/1.1
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
